libm (rust-lang) — MIT License
================================================================================

src/math_wat.rs contains the compiled WebAssembly text of the libm crate,
version 0.2.16 — the functions pow, exp, log, log2 and log10 and their
compiler-builtins helpers — extracted by tools/gen_math_wat.py from a
wasm32-unknown-unknown build of tools/mathwat. libm is a port of MUSL's
libm to Rust (https://github.com/rust-lang/libm; development continues in
rust-lang/compiler-builtins). Its LICENSE.txt states: "rust-lang/libm as a
whole is available for use under the MIT license"; the standard MIT terms
reproduced in the p2w section below apply equally here.

